(MUNICIPAL REGULATORY BYLAWS - 2026) Tj
T* (Chapter 1: Statutory Operational Provisions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Section 1.1: Administrative Authority and Jurisdiction) Tj
T* (Under the powers conferred by the Local Government Enabling Act,) Tj
T* (the municipal council hereby establishes the standards of Chapter 1.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Every registered property owner shall comply with municipal codes;) Tj
T* (2. Applications must be submitted in writing with certified architectural drawings;) Tj
T* (3. Inspections shall be conducted during normal business hours.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (\(a\) Residential permits expire twelve months from date of issuance;) Tj
T* (\(b\) Commercial zoning variances require public hearing notifications;) Tj
T* (\(c\) Appeals must be lodged within 30 days of the decision date.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
